    "turn_text": "Well, it is an amoral government. I always say this. It's an amoral government, not an amoral people, right? Because we've seen what's happened to the people of China. We've seen what they've done to the Uighurs and that they're using them as slave labor. And God only knows what they do to them in these reeducation camps in China. But when you have Democrats as well, louding China like, I couldn't believe it when I heard Senator Dianne Feinstein's recent statements on China. And she talked about them being respectable and working with China instead of holding China accountable. And we see that from the Democrats that they blame President Trump for this virus rather than blame the Chinese government. And that is really disconcerting.",
