    "turn_idx": 20,
    "turn_text": "I think that they are trying to hide Joe Biden as best they can. President Trump is on TV every day. He's working hard on the response to this virus. He is doing the kinds of things that Americans appreciate. And at the same time, Joe Biden is hiding and really his public appearances have gone down. It is unfortunate that we have a situation where we won't have a full and robust election campaign for either party. And that's too bad because I think more people see the contrast between President Trump and his leadership and Joe Biden and his lack of leadership and really his challenges that he's facing right now. I think that the people will overwhelmingly choose President Trump, but I still think people can't be fooled. The fact that Joe Biden isn't going to do debates or may not do debates is a clear indication that he's not prepared for office.",
